    "body": "If I understand correctly from the explanation, it is better to replace instances of `F.linear` or `torch.nn.functional.linear` calls that run with no quantization with this wrapper `dispatch_unquantized_gemm()`.\r\nbecause `dispatch_unquantized_gemm` can choose the right device path? \r\n\r\nhere:\r\nhttps://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/314053177332342e47bd046f134a69ea324b864c/vllm/model_executor/layers/utils.py#L561-L569\r\n\r\nfor example should we also replace the fallback path here?\r\nhttps://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/314053177332342e47bd046f134a69ea324b864c/vllm/model_executor/layers/fused_moe/router/gate_linear.py#L207-L229\r\n",
